<title>MOROCCO: SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT SIERRA LEONE 4-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT SIERRA LEONE 4-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco beat Sierra Leone 4-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in their World Cup African zone group five</p>
<p>qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Larbi Hababi 18, Khalid Raghib 50, 55, Youssef</p>
<p>Fertout 57</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
</text>
